","target":"#keywords-for-strings","line":23},{"title":"regexp","target":"#regexp","line":24},{"title":"formatMaximum / formatMinimum and formatExclusiveMaximum / formatExclusiveMinimum","target":"#formatmaximum--formatminimum-and-formatexclusivemaximum--formatexclusiveminimum","line":25},{"title":"transform","target":"#transform","line":26},{"title":"Keywords for arrays","target":"#keywords-for-arrays","line":27},{"title":"uniqueItemProperties","target":"#uniqueitemproperties","line":28},{"title":"Keywords for objects","target":"#keywords-for-objects","line":29},{"title":"allRequired","target":"#allrequired","line":30},{"title":"anyRequired","target":"#anyrequired","line":31},{"title":"oneRequired","target":"#onerequired","line":32},{"title":"patternRequired","target":"#patternrequired","line":33},{"title":"prohibited","target":"#prohibited","line":34},{"title":"deepProperties","target":"#deepproperties","line":35},{"title":"deepRequired","target":"#deeprequired","line":36},{"title":"Compound keywords","target":"#compound-keywords","line":37},{"title":"switch","target":"#switch","line":38},{"title":"select/selectCases/selectDefault","target":"#selectselectcasesselectdefault","line":39},{"title":"Keywords for all types","target":"#keywords-for-all-types","line":40},{"title":"dynamicDefaults","target":"#dynamicdefaults","line":41},{"title":"Security contact","target":"#security-contact","line":42},{"title":"Open-source software support","target":"#open-source-software-support","line":43},{"title":"License","target":"#license","line":44},{"title":"addFormat","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv#api-addformat","line":199},{"title":"@blainesch","target":"https://github.com/blainesch","line":310},{"title":"json-schema-org/json-schema-spec#203","target":"https://github.com/json-schema-org/json-schema-spec/issues/203#issue-197211916","line":519},{"title":"$data reference","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv/tree/5.0.2-beta.0#data-reference","line":601},{"title":"$data reference","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv/tree/5.0.2-beta.0#data-reference","line":614},{"title":"tests","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv-keywords/blob/v2.0.0/spec/tests/select.json#L314","line":668},{"title":"default keyword treated by Ajv","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv#assigning-defaults","line":677},{"title":"0, 1) interval\n- `\"randomint\"` - pseudo-random integer number. If string is used as a property value, the function will randomly return 0 or 1. If object `{ func: 'randomint', args: { max: N } }` is used then the default will be an integer number in [0, N) interval.\n- `\"seq\"` - sequential integer number starting from 0. If string is used as a property value, the default sequence will be used. If object `{ func: 'seq', args: { name: 'foo'} }` is used then the sequence with name `\"foo\"` will be used. Sequences are global, even if different ajv instances are used.\n\n```javascript\nvar schema = {\n  type: 'object',\n  dynamicDefaults: {\n    ts: 'datetime',\n    r: { func: 'randomint', args: { max: 100 } },\n    id: { func: 'seq', args: { name: 'id' } }\n  },\n  properties: {\n    ts: {\n      type: 'string',\n      format: 'date-time'\n    },\n    r: {\n      type: 'integer',\n      minimum: 0,\n      exclusiveMaximum: 100\n    },\n    id: {\n      type: 'integer',\n      minimum: 0\n    }\n  }\n};\n\nvar data = {};\najv.validate(data); // true\ndata; // { ts: '2016-12-01T22:07:28.829Z', r: 25, id: 0 }\n\nvar data1 = {};\najv.validate(data1); // true\ndata1; // { ts: '2016-12-01T22:07:29.832Z', r: 68, id: 1 }\n\najv.validate(data1); // true\ndata1; // didn't change, as all properties were defined\n```\n\nWhen using the `useDefaults` option value `\"empty\"`, properties and items equal to `null` or `\"\"` (empty string) will be considered missing and assigned defaults.  Use the `allOf` [compound keyword","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv/blob/master/KEYWORDS.md#compound-keywords","line":692},{"title":"Tidelift security contact","target":"https://tidelift.com/security","line":823},{"title":"Tidelift subscription","target":"https://tidelift.com/subscription/pkg/npm-ajv-keywords?utm_source=npm-ajv-keywords&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=readme","line":831},{"title":"MIT","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv-keywords/blob/master/LICENSE","line":836}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[51,53],[60,67],[71,73],[77,79],[83,85],[100,104],[115,119],[123,130],[143,157],[170,188],[203,216],[242,257],[260,275],[288,308],[329,342],[353,362],[373,382],[395,402],[413,424],[437,482],[493,517],[550,570],[574,592],[617,666],[696,731],[735,768],[772,793],[797,817]]},
